quest title=The Last Frequency
quest intro=The Receiver's last frequency: a quarry, and five mirrors listening to the sea. Go ashore at the landing.
step reach|rim_landing|1|Go ashore at the quarry's landing
step read|Quarry Foreman's board|1|Read the foreman's board
step read|Mirror 1 log|1|Read mirror 1's log on the rim
step collect|story:power|1|Start the generator by mirror 1
step collect|story:hum|1|Listen on mirror 1's receiver
step read|Mirror 2 log|1|Read mirror 2's log
step collect|story:hutopen|1|Open the mirror control hut (its code is in the bearings)
step collect|story:fuse|1|Take the mirror fuse
step reach|chapel|1|Go into the Choir's chapel on the east rim
step read|The Listener's sermon|1|Read the Listener's sermon
step kill|Hyena|6|Fight off the Choir's dogs
step open|Wren's bundle|1|Free Sister Wren (the chapel's key opens her cage) and open her bundle
step read|Wren's warning|1|Hear Wren's warning
step open|Reliquary|1|Open the Choir's reliquary
step collect|story:bellrope|1|Take the bell rope
step collect|story:bellrung|1|Ring the chapel bell
step reach|crane_base|1|Go to the crane by the pit
step collect|story:hookmoved|1|Pull the crane lever
step reach|crane_cab|1|Climb to the crane cab
step read|Crane operator's note|1|Read the crane operator's note
step collect|story:sluiceup|1|Fit the fuse and work the claw
step collect|story:lure|1|Pick up the light on the road down
step reach|pit_edge|1|Go down to the pit's edge
step collect|story:toothset|1|Lay the Lantern-Mother's tooth on the altar
step kill|Angler fish|1|Defeat the Lantern-Mother
step reach|pit_floor|1|Dive to the pit's floor
step read|The last hymn|1|Read the last hymn
step collect|story:silence|1|Turn mirror 1 on the song
step open|Choir treasury|1|Open the Choir's treasury
step read|Pim's drawing|1|Read Pim's drawing
step reach|quarry_top|1|Climb to the top of the quarry
quest done=At 3:12 the Receiver is silent. Pim sleeps without humming.
quest reward=HealingSalve_Good*2;TitaniumIngot*3;TradeToken*12

# Buried treasure (one of the story line's last islands): titanium ore on top of Raft's own treasure loot - the metal detector finds it, the shovel digs it
call treasure x=0 z=0 r=36 n=1 seed=8824
prop treasure8824 treasure.loot=TitaniumOre*3

save The Listening Mirrors
